# Decision-layer thresholds fitted on DEV and graded on the gate split
# (docs/13 §11, 2026-09-28; reports/t1_decision_layer_calibration_gate.json).
# P1-S, P1-F and P1-T pass with these.
#
# Read before enabling: on the gate split the clone rule BLOCKs 7.5-12 % of
# genuine calls (dev budget was 1 %). Switch it on only if that false-BLOCK
# rate is acceptable for the flow, or with a fallback path for BLOCKed callers.
#
# The CM needs the operating-point checkpoint written by T1:
#   VR_CM_BACKEND=aasist  VR_CM_AASIST_WEIGHTS=<path to cm_aasist_op.pt>
VR_CLONE_CM_LLR_MAX=-2.4568
VR_CLONE_MIN_WINDOWS=3
VR_CHALLENGE_CM_LLR_MAX=0.5757
VR_CHALLENGE_MIN_WINDOWS=2
VR_CHALLENGE_TRIGGER_CONSECUTIVE=3
